  "question": {
    "text": "A given mass of gas expands from state A to state B by three paths 1, 2 and 3 as shown in the figure<br />\r<img src=\"assets\\qt0091_dcddfbaca943.jpeg\" style=\"width:1.54167in;height:1.26667in\" /><br />\rIf <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> respectively are be the works done by the gas along three paths, then"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
